<header class="ws-head"><p class="ws-kicker">Worksheet &middot; History by century</p><h1 class="ws-title">Worksheet: The 10th century</h1><p class="ws-lede">A worksheet on the 900s: the states, events and people of the century. Use its page to find the answers.</p><p class="ws-who" aria-hidden="true"><span>Name</span><span>Class</span><span>Date</span></p><p class="ws-tools"><button type="button" class="ws-print" data-key="0">Print the worksheet</button><button type="button" class="ws-print" data-key="1">Print with the answers</button><a href="/centuries/10th-century">Open the century page &rarr;</a></p></header>
<section class="ws-task"><h2><span class="ws-n">1</span>Name the states on the map</h2><p class="ws-how">Each number marks the capital or seat of a state that existed in 950 CE. Write its name from the word bank on the line with the same number.</p><figure class="ws-mapfig"><svg class="map map-world ws-map" viewBox="0 0 10384 5465" role="img" aria-label="Map: 8 numbered states of the world in 950 CE"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><g class="ws-pins"><g><circle cx="5709" cy="970" r="177"/><text x="5709" y="1044" font-size="212">1</text></g><g><circle cx="7833" cy="2434" r="177"/><text x="7833" y="2508" font-size="212">2</text></g><g><circle cx="6134" cy="1224" r="177"/><text x="6134" y="1299" font-size="212">3</text></g><g><circle cx="4782" cy="1851" r="177"/><text x="4782" y="1925" font-size="212">4</text></g><g><circle cx="4881" cy="1071" r="177"/><text x="4881" y="1146" font-size="212">5</text></g><g><circle cx="7866" cy="1006" r="177"/><text x="7866" y="1080" font-size="212">6</text></g><g><circle cx="5229" cy="694" r="177"/><text x="5229" y="768" font-size="212">7</text></g><g><circle cx="7846" cy="1933" r="177"/><text x="7846" y="2007" font-size="212">8</text></g></g></svg><figcaption>The world in 950 CE</figcaption></figure><p class="ws-bank"><b>Word bank:</b> Holy Roman Empire &middot; Byzantine Empire &middot; Srivijaya Empire &middot; Caliphate of Córdoba &middot; Ghana Empire &middot; Abbasid Caliphate &middot; Khmer Empire &middot; Liao dynasty</p><ol class="ws-blanks"><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li><li><span class="ws-line1"></span></li></ol></section>
<section class="ws-task"><h2><span class="ws-n">2</span>Put the events in order</h2><p class="ws-how">Number the events from 1 (earliest) to 6 (latest).</p><ul class="ws-order"><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Chenqiao Mutiny</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Treaty of Saint-Clair-sur-Epte</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Battle of Pressburg</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Battle of Lechfeld</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Battle of Simancas</span></li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Great Slav Rising</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="ws-task"><h2><span class="ws-n">3</span>Match the people to their dates</h2><p class="ws-how">Write the number of the right dates next to each person. Look them up in the encyclopedia.</p><div class="ws-match"><ol class="ws-ma" type="A"><li>Ibn Battuta</li><li>Abd al-Rahman III</li><li>Harald Fairhair</li><li>Sviatoslav I of Kiev</li><li>Henry the Fowler</li><li>Æthelstan</li></ol><ol class="ws-mb"><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span>c. 850 – c. 932</li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span>c. 942–972 CE</li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span>891–961</li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span>1304–1368/69</li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span>c. 894–939</li><li><span class="ws-box" aria-hidden="true"></span>c. 876–936</li></ol></div></section>
<section class="ws-task"><h2><span class="ws-n">4</span>Think and discuss</h2><ol class="ws-qs"><li><p>In the 900s, 170 recorded states were founded and 137 came to an end. Choose one of each from the century page. What happened to them?</p><span class="ws-lines" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></li><li><p>The great powers of the age included the Byzantine Empire, the Srivijaya Empire and the Abbasid Caliphate. Choose one: what made it strong in these hundred years, and what threatened it?</p><span class="ws-lines" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></li><li><p>Choose one event from the list and one person. How might they be connected? Use the encyclopedia to find out.</p><span class="ws-lines" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></li><li><p>If you could visit one place in the 10th century, where would you go, and what would you hope to see?</p><span class="ws-lines" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></li></ol></section>
<p class="ws-src">From The Epoch Institute: the-epoch-institute.org/centuries/10th-century. Free to print and copy for use in class.</p>
<details class="ws-key" id="answers"><summary>Answer key</summary><div class="ws-key-b"><p class="ws-key-t">Answer key: Worksheet: The 10th century</p><section><h2><span class="ws-n">1</span>Name the states on the map</h2><ol class="ws-key-list"><li>Byzantine Empire <span>330 CE – 1453 CE</span></li><li>Srivijaya Empire <span>650 CE – 1377 CE</span></li><li>Abbasid Caliphate <span>750 CE – 1517 CE</span></li><li>Ghana Empire <span>300 CE – 1240 CE</span></li><li>Caliphate of Córdoba <span>929 CE – 1031 CE</span></li><li>Liao dynasty <span>916 CE – 1125 CE</span></li><li>Holy Roman Empire <span>800 CE – 1806 CE</span></li><li>Khmer Empire <span>802 CE – 1431 CE</span></li></ol></section><section><h2><span class="ws-n">2</span>Put the events in order</h2><ol class="ws-key-list"><li>Battle of Pressburg <span>907</span></li><li>Treaty of Saint-Clair-sur-Epte <span>911</span></li><li>Battle of Simancas <span>939</span></li><li>Battle of Lechfeld <span>955 CE</span></li><li>Chenqiao Mutiny <span>960 CE</span></li><li>Great Slav Rising <span>983</span></li></ol></section><section><h2><span class="ws-n">3</span>Match the people to their dates</h2><ol class="ws-key-list" type="A"><li>Ibn Battuta <span>4: 1304–1368/69</span></li><li>Abd al-Rahman III <span>3: 891–961</span></li><li>Harald Fairhair <span>1: c. 850 – c. 932</span></li><li>Sviatoslav I of Kiev <span>2: c. 942–972 CE</span></li><li>Henry the Fowler <span>6: c. 876–936</span></li><li>Æthelstan <span>5: c. 894–939</span></li></ol></section><section><h2><span class="ws-n">4</span>Think and discuss</h2><p class="ws-key-note">Open questions: answers will vary. Good answers name states, people and events from the century page.</p></section></div></details>
